      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>A break doesn't really change the reality of it though. Even if I take a week off, she's still the one doing the laundry, the cooking, the driving me to appointments... she's still the one carrying everything. I'm just taking up space and resources that she'd be better off using for herself. It feels like my presence is just making her life harder every single day.",
